  - Sentinel
  - Landsat
  - SAR
  - field campaigns
abstract: >-
  Static, client-side web application that predicts when Earth-observation
  instruments image a point or polygon region of interest, from orbital
  elements propagated with SGP4 and the intersection of each instrument swath
  with the region in a local equal-area projection. It reports time (UTC and
  local), coverage, viewing and illumination geometry, orbit direction,
  expected cloud and atmospheric conditions, and whether the acquisition is
  systematic or a tasking opportunity, and cross-checks Sentinel-1/-2 passes
  against ESA acquisition plans and past passes against real acquisitions in
  STAC catalogues.
